{"id":"661470114","kind":"article","title":"为别人写质量上乘的卡片可能比给自己写优质卡片更难","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3VMP8i1HKdfn1nr9kB8zqTqGwVexnWx4R3s7"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2023-10-16","updated":"2023-10-16","votes":7,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":470,"keywords":["间隔重复","卡片设计","助记媒介","反馈","知识的诅咒"],"summary":"作者认为，为他人编写优质间隔重复卡片比为自己写更难：自己复习时能从错误或烦躁中获得反馈，但卡片作者往往不复习材料，也不一定能发现问题；此外，作者熟悉内容，容易受到“知识的诅咒”影响，高估卡片效果。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/661470114","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"JpnDWv4m\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3ntJ7w9C3uapYp1m3gy2EK6PN788guzEoUNN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，特别是那些在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4rRX3qwSSJRsEkdXKwH2shamgHNeRthrMLiF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>里得为别人编写卡片的作者来说，我觉得这更是难上加难。</p><p data-pid=\"4OHxg4Cr\">当你为自己写卡片时，至少在复习时有机会发现问题：比如你可能发现有的卡片总是答不对，或者每次遇到都让人烦躁。然而，大多数作者并非对这些材料一无所知，因此他们或许根本不会亲自复习这些卡片，即使复习，也不会太投入。（具体可见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z44Y2oioTS1nH8cN2RSVJHKgRpVvR9Fa77DHq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">复习环节能为卡片写作提供多少反馈？</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>）</p><p data-pid=\"XyQMbgyn\">此外，作者还会受到<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3LNzCSZnpSzFWHLboKqhRrGDTxLw48hZAsPM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">知识的诅咒</a>影响，这让他们容易高估自己卡片的效果。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"-XBpCXGd\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"GyAv5TZe\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 GPT-4，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3VMP8i1HKdfn1nr9kB8zqTqGwVexnWx4R3s7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Writing good prompts for others is likely harder than writing good prompts for oneself (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397245681\" href=\"#/post/397245681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 助记媒介（Mnemonic medium） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 复习环节能为卡片写作提供多少反馈？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"412393170\" href=\"#/post/412393170\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"661273104","title":"电子书的流行程度远低于纸质书","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"662320156","title":"编写非技术性助记文本需要额外的概念抓手","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"397245681","title":"写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"459483765","title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"412393170","title":"复习环节能为卡片写作提供多少反馈？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}